#: scenario3:scenario3_B160FB80_A524_4386_B4F3_E09D32BB5AD9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: df49cc44831c63b140af42e94a98711430acc1a34062864b8827a0d1f6f59cb8
