#: scenario3:scenario3_72DD4588_D919_4D40_BBCF_10DF9071DC19
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ebee5dcac70210fc3dceae4703af64402fd4e4458a43d44f785fbec6e25a470c
#. default-sha256: 863f031d874415477d90025f285e13a8f5d81a61c4fdeb809531fb20c87e6249
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_72DD4588_D919_4D40_BBCF_10DF9071DC19"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫All I wanted... ⟪k:1⟫was to go back to the way things used to be..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Tudo o que eu queria... ⟪k:1⟫ era que as coisas voltassem a ser como eram..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_01DC8432_29AC_498E_8127_F1AD66CE1DDB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 58aa5c4bd054ba9d3169bd77a25bd44ce1ad62f8e013f4910869ab6694129c97
#. default-sha256: 337597e5bff1bd8030f969df08ebeb6613ae7c179ac8492ef262962c80e52561
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_01DC8432_29AC_498E_8127_F1AD66CE1DDB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫for us... ⟪k:1⟫to be able to smile around each other..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫que nós... ⟪k:1⟫ conseguíssemos sorrir um para o outro..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_25F5F851_BFB4_432D_AA33_50BD5DFE8B65
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f408ee51e227904d78b4e1c8c47e4fed4f46587d2e393f89081608e9c32b8f61
#. default-sha256: 71e28d66e43db64c77b213712efe2b36a9b29df5c4c5772ded669b90ce927692
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_25F5F851_BFB4_432D_AA33_50BD5DFE8B65"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫It had been several days since Jacopo had locked her in the shed,⟪k:5⟫"
"and her day-to-day life was only growing more arduous."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Fazia vários dias que Jacopo a trancara no galpão,⟪k:5⟫e seu dia-a-dia "
"estava ficando cada vez mais árduo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_76ED8843_768C_428F_BF16_59040FFF0399
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 131e89ce750b725027ba065b792370c142d5cd745840522ba97672ce639be4c1
#. default-sha256: 005960220354960aec7963a4e896038ccf939d87f27a7cef29d3407cccf1f6d6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_76ED8843_768C_428F_BF16_59040FFF0399"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She was under constant surveillance."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ela estava sob vigilância constante."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D63AC5CD_BE9C_4C09_8D08_7FF9D24AC514
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 86d18186fa4afc0414e859f21a338124b583e158fa263110141f827825d84957
#. default-sha256: 27c2f66bddcedcf1cc5752f5ab728ed23706b73c6f0c061d57e51a19eb918aaa
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D63AC5CD_BE9C_4C09_8D08_7FF9D24AC514"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The door was only unlocked to deliver her meals, three times a day."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫A porta só era destrancada para entregar suas refeições, três vezes ao dia."

#: scenario3:scenario3_5E0ECD43_A9F7_47DE_B584_A98423B18D9E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f47f18693b78ac873437d46ecd72a617f62e1f329ce54999b0c28970299dfe5b
#. default-sha256: f5078be6554752301c71f24c2647ec0f7879a04964ebf03321bf20927115a034
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5E0ECD43_A9F7_47DE_B584_A98423B18D9E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And despite what an unfortunate situation their employer’s wife found herself in, the maids "
"chattered and gossiped and giggled freely."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E apesar da situação infeliz em que a esposa de seu patrão se encontrava, as criadas "
"tagarelavam, fofocavam e riam livremente."

#: scenario3:scenario3_ABAB1144_F8DD_44EA_ADD4_9EA3ED993684
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c682a80e9542551ab2c71dcd7fec22600ad1ab7656492a586cd4c1d1e6d107d7
#. default-sha256: a07ae216b5c4530b0e0f5bd5108f0749a5893c15280ceb7871a2ac07cb2d77ef
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_ABAB1144_F8DD_44EA_ADD4_9EA3ED993684"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Not even in the shadows, out of her presence—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫the tactless young maidservants "
"whispered directly to the White-Haired Girl when they brought her meals."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nem mesmo nas sombras, fora de sua presença—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫as jovens criadas deselegantemente "
"sussurravam diretamente para a Garota de Cabelos Brancos quando traziam suas refeições."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9D6D222B_02A2_461F_8BBA_9C81BD4803FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b398eaecb9e3f62ef789e0932a9845e6c74097511df570ae5ad686ca1eab19d7
#. default-sha256: 62e3cefa0f345725d4919b9e86225a1f8f793caf371d14b63fcf6a0d569667df
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9D6D222B_02A2_461F_8BBA_9C81BD4803FD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“Look at you, Madam. Caged away like cattle.”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“Olhe para você, Madame. Enjaulada como gado.”"

#: scenario3:scenario3_0236D815_8CAC_4C3B_B583_610E835AA4EA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2c497eef41e5570b66602910fbb94a85743874b42686de7cf27fc21345993170
#. default-sha256: 305f6cb21a9495f9d61a981420731fb23d2d86885241e5fdf2ea93959aa6b8bb
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0236D815_8CAC_4C3B_B583_610E835AA4EA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I could almost hear the sound of cracks forming in her heart."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Eu quase podia ouvir o som de rachaduras se formando em seu coração."

#: scenario3:scenario3_2BCE54D9_DEE5_487E_90CA_9A57CB8DF929
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 59e2a9619b3d0d0ca0ce30d2823ed2472ac7572c559eb55b8a2d62899e83a7a6
#. default-sha256: 48141e57dab120c2598c6b9daa98077bd58e0de52dd3c5c6ef00fc12c5fdefc8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2BCE54D9_DEE5_487E_90CA_9A57CB8DF929"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I imagine she had gotten to the point where she was having difficulty merely holding herself "
"together. ⟪k:1⟫She had done nothing wrong, and yet she was forced to live this life of insults "
"and mockery."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Imagino que ela tenha chegado ao ponto em que estava tendo dificuldade até para se manter "
"sã. ⟪k:1⟫Ela não tinha feito nada de errado, e ainda assim foi forçada a viver essa vida de "
"insultos e zombaria."

#: scenario3:scenario3_078106BF_26F7_4D9F_B146_205839DB0BD6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eacacbf624907b3f9f68d504edc83bb450438d79705f292359212c33ef9c6065
#. default-sha256: 4452caffb70cef295b6f2ff9f6790566bba6984caae3f73c8b57d532f7ae2e73
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_078106BF_26F7_4D9F_B146_205839DB0BD6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Of ridicule."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫De ridicularização."

#: scenario3:scenario3_EB2B0C5C_A288_4438_A0BD_8185567DD586
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f8da630369a97ffddc2b838efd317a24b4990b1b55ebdbaaa0c7ff4aeffb0209
#. default-sha256: 72b298123a4195e247bd1bcab3ddbf1a79e4852a18e4529b56ae66f5fe536c00
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_EB2B0C5C_A288_4438_A0BD_8185567DD586"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The only reason her tenuously held together spirit did not completely shatter was because "
"she still had her one and only ally."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A única razão pela qual seu espírito fracamente unido não se despedaçou completamente foi "
"porque ela ainda tinha sua única aliada."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C0D14612_A806_49A7_AD7A_AB2A57C74595
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0ad88fcc268021fd3b6091632f8b338c3e23f5581e68eb3236dbd12a933e4b42
#. default-sha256: 90d2705c3cd67e78dca4b133e1c222d7935e2d762f2da112ff0072f070620667
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C0D14612_A806_49A7_AD7A_AB2A57C74595"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The maid Maria volunteered to attend to the White-Haired Girl."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫A criada Maria se ofereceu para atender a Garota de Cabelos Brancos."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7211AC07_1F5C_4E7B_AA4D_1E09E86C26C4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4e3904a91b788f2e2351ee89226c1314146ac832a8fe5ef44c2870e68539aaf7
#. default-sha256: a214a14aba25f111e8fb8411eca6fc36eb8918a61cd0c120679ce474de3f4736
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7211AC07_1F5C_4E7B_AA4D_1E09E86C26C4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maria took over the duty of delivering her three meals, meaning the other maids stopped "
"coming by."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maria assumiu a tarefa de entregar suas três refeições, o que significava que as outras "
"criadas pararam de ir."

#: scenario3:scenario3_712172B1_5B9F_4386_BF8A_59BC684D38C0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f5955be7845781c85f6c2e70e91b6609c370ed911f76d959ab796ac246466b59
#. default-sha256: 068df6cb59b0803ebfbadb4226a61857f1eebdf921911cc63e1c84428c719b82
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_712172B1_5B9F_4386_BF8A_59BC684D38C0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And that relieved the White-Haired Girl’s mental and emotional stress considerably."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E isso aliviou consideravelmente o estresse mental e emocional da Garota de Cabelos Brancos."

#: scenario3:scenario3_014F5C94_F506_45A2_B7F9_BEEA11F15129
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd93bd9dfa573416d0ec4d05bd777fb7e93ae025d8530eb833adbc55abb7d267
#. default-sha256: bc291a8585199b099b8ddd573326c2024ae7e5f2988b41057cf7e6964cab2021
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_014F5C94_F506_45A2_B7F9_BEEA11F15129"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maria became her sole conversation partner, her sole companion.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫She did not leave "
"as soon as meals were finished, instead remaining in the shed with the White-Haired Girl for some "
"time."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maria tornou-se sua única parceira de conversa, sua única companheira. ⟪k:1⟫Ela não saia "
"assim que as refeições terminavam, em vez disso, permanecia no galpão com a Garota de Cabelos "
"Brancos por algum tempo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_BCFD5ACC_E8B5_4165_9D19_82B98BCB3AEE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
