#: scenario3:scenario3_DFC320FD_FEA3_41B0_B8D1_0270A68407BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a69719b5ca6e390325794446b58be28d24a20cebc00d77bf03e27a83ec949087
#. default-sha256: ba359b478bcc1be8ffa40cc70422ede6b4156bf31a25c272530dc916a48d4f4d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DFC320FD_FEA3_41B0_B8D1_0270A68407BD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫S-⟪k:2⟫So, ⟪k:3⟫uh, ⟪k:4⟫Madam, how ’bout a funny story?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫I flubbed up pretty "
"hard the other day. You wanna hear about that?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫E-⟪k:2⟫Então, ⟪k:3⟫huh, ⟪k:4⟫Madame, que tal uma história engraçada?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Eu me "
"embananei pra caramba no outro dia. Você quer ouvir sobre isso?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_378947F8_2A37_4B64_B4E0_BB55B07C4C94
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
